<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 74.4800 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 74.4800 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.4800 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.2000 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 28		  Apr 25</p>
<p> High			     75.0600		 75.7000</p>
<p> Low				74.4500		 75.0000</p>
<p> Open			     74.9100		 75.7000</p>
<p> Close			    74.4800		 75.2000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    6.375		   3.900</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
